// Robust COGO Test Script - Horizontal Curves and RKRK Functionality
// This script will deeply test Range-Known Range-Known intersections
// across multiple points, and subsequently test the curve generation 
// feature using XC commands within active figures.

CLEAR
LOG ON

// ==========================================
// 1. Establish Control Network
// ==========================================
NE 1 5000.0000 5000.0000 "Base SW"
NE 2 6000.0000 5000.0000 "Base NW"
NE 3 5000.0000 6000.0000 "Base SE"
NE 4 6000.0000 6000.0000 "Base NE"

// ==========================================
// 2. RKRK Intersections (Distance-Distance)
// ==========================================
// Form an expanding intersection pattern using P1 and P2
RKRK 100 1 500.0 2 500.0
RKRK 101 1 600.0 2 600.0
RKRK 102 1 700.0 2 700.0
RKRK 103 1 800.0 2 800.0
RKRK 104 1 900.0 2 900.0

// Form another expanding pattern using P3 and P4
RKRK 200 3 500.0 4 500.0
RKRK 201 3 600.0 4 600.0
RKRK 202 3 700.0 4 700.0
RKRK 203 3 800.0 4 800.0
RKRK 204 3 900.0 4 900.0

// Intersect the newly calculated intersection points 
// (RKRK engine generates both Right <Pt> and Left <Pt>_L solutions automatically)
// Here we use the primary Right solutions to branch out further into the grid.
RKRK 300 100 500.0 200 500.0
RKRK 301 101 600.0 201 600.0
RKRK 302 102 700.0 202 700.0

// ==========================================
// 3. Horizontal Curves (XC Command)
// ==========================================
// The XC Command creates a curve sub-segment. 
// It MUST be enclosed within a Figure that has a starting Point (CONT).

// --- Curvilinear Boundary 1 ---
BEG TRACT_1
CONT 1
// Usage parsed structurally: XC ZD (BULB) [radius] [chord-az] [chord-dis]
// Engine will append synthesized curve points smoothly onto the active figure
XC ZD (BULB) 100.0 45.0000 50.0
XC ZD (BULB) 150.0 90.0000 75.0
XC ZD (BULB) 200.0 135.0000 100.0
XC ZD (BULB) 250.0 180.0000 125.0
CONT 3
CONT 1
END

// Validate the tract closure including the synthetic curve segments
MAPCHECK TRACT_1

// --- Curvilinear Boundary 2 ---
BEG TRACT_2
CONT 2
// Extending different chord variations via BD parsing structure
XC BD (BULB) 300.0 1 45.00 150.0
XC BD (BULB) 350.0 2 45.00 175.0
XC BD (BULB) 400.0 3 45.00 200.0
XC BD (BULB) 450.0 4 45.00 225.0
CONT 4
CONT 2
END

// Validate the second tract closure
MAPCHECK TRACT_2

// ==========================================
// 4. Verification and Validation
// ==========================================
// Verify generated points spanning across the intersections
INV 100 300
INV 102 302
INV 200 300

SAVE curves_and_rkrk_test.cogo
LOG OFF
